@host = http://localhost:8080

### Manual RAG: retrieve -> template -> ChatModel
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is a good truck to pull a Sportsman 232 boat?"
}

### Same question through the AI Service's retrieval augmentor (LangChain4j-only)
POST {{host}}/ask/augmented
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is a good truck to pull a Sportsman 232 boat?"
}
